OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness to start, but
OL,6,Fcloud generally building through the
OL,7,Fmorning, with a few outbreaks of light
OL,8,Frain possible across the Pennines.
OL,9,FSunny spells developing across the
OL,10,Feast during the afternoon, where it
OL,11,Fwill feel warm. Light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly cloudy into the
OL,14,Fevening, with the best of any clearer
OL,15,Fspells in the east. Patchy light rain
OL,16,Fpossible across the Pennines, but dry
OL,17,Felsewhere. Mild with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
